Inspect the per-sample results of a run.

Usage
  azd ai eval run output [command]

Available Commands
  export : Export the complete run results as JSON.
  list   : List the per-sample results of a run.
  show   : Show a single evaluated row. The id is the ITEM column of `azd ai eval run output list`.

Global Flags
  -C, --cwd string         : Sets the current working directory
      --debug              : Enables debug and diagnostics logging
  -e, --environment string : The name of the environment to use
  -h, --help               : help for output
      --no-prompt          : Runs without prompts. Uses existing values; fails if any required value or decision cannot be resolved automatically.
  -o, --output string      : The output format (default "default")

Examples
  List per-sample results of the latest run
    azd ai eval run output list --eval quality

Use azd ai eval run output [command] --help to view examples and more information about a specific command.
